1
00:00:56,280 --> 00:01:02,560
(The Shadow Sovereign)

2
00:01:02,641 --> 00:01:05,330
(Episode 16)

3
00:01:08,126 --> 00:01:09,192
We're departing today?

4
00:01:09,282 --> 00:01:11,842
If we get there a day sooner, maybe we can save someone in time.

5
00:01:13,324 --> 00:01:14,605
You're risking your life out there.

6
00:01:14,629 --> 00:01:16,480
At least, Shen Xiao is still in the capital.

7
00:01:16,713 --> 00:01:19,881
Father will arrange a marriage for him and Jin Cheng.

8
00:01:21,189 --> 00:01:24,432
Jin Cheng's older brother is the Grand General of the Shence Camp.

9
00:01:24,829 --> 00:01:26,632
With this alliance backing you,

10
00:01:26,997 --> 00:01:28,847
it'll be easier for you to navigate the court.

11
00:01:28,989 --> 00:01:30,191
An arranged marriage?

12
00:01:34,205 --> 00:01:35,407
I turned it down.

13
00:01:40,486 --> 00:01:42,448
His Majesty demoted me to Censor.

14
00:01:42,805 --> 00:01:44,925
I'm heading to the Yellow River with Prince Le Sheng.

15
00:01:52,829 --> 00:01:54,152
I'll wait for you outside.

16
00:01:54,470 --> 00:01:55,872
I'll head out, too.

17
00:01:58,829 --> 00:02:00,869
You defied the imperial order and refused to marry?

18
00:02:01,405 --> 00:02:04,000
You know me. I won't marry Jin Cheng.

19
00:02:04,461 --> 00:02:05,904
You should know,

20
00:02:06,470 --> 00:02:09,952
no one from a humble family has ever risen as high as you in court.

21
00:02:10,389 --> 00:02:12,706
Marrying Jin Cheng and aligning with Prince Qi

22
00:02:12,820 --> 00:02:15,583
is your only way to secure your place in court.

23
00:02:16,270 --> 00:02:18,280
If I have to betray my heart to get ahead,

24
00:02:19,149 --> 00:02:20,832
then I don't want that kind of future.

25
00:02:23,910 --> 00:02:25,272
Your heart?

26
00:02:25,869 --> 00:02:28,120
Will your heart keep you alive?

27
00:02:28,869 --> 00:02:31,552
Can it survive the palace and noble families' schemes?

28
00:02:32,117 --> 00:02:33,518
Without power,

29
00:02:33,956 --> 00:02:36,158
you don't even get to talk about it.

30
00:02:36,989 --> 00:02:39,071
You've made a move that'll get you killed.

31
00:02:39,790 --> 00:02:40,992
That's the worst plan.

32
00:02:41,453 --> 00:02:43,176
But it's not a dead end.

33
00:02:43,989 --> 00:02:45,186
I'm going there this time

34
00:02:45,269 --> 00:02:47,071
to fight for a chance.

35
00:02:47,493 --> 00:02:48,695
Trust me.

36
00:02:59,589 --> 00:03:00,832
This hairpin

37
00:03:02,549 --> 00:03:04,432
was broken when I found it.

38
00:03:05,070 --> 00:03:06,791
I could only try to fix it.

39
00:03:22,205 --> 00:03:24,200
What do I need this useless thing for?

40
00:03:27,230 --> 00:03:28,346
What I want

41
00:03:28,463 --> 00:03:30,780
is for you to fight for your place in court!

42
00:03:30,861 --> 00:03:32,704
Not to be a sitting duck and get killed!

43
00:03:47,102 --> 00:03:48,383
Take care, Your Highness.

44
00:04:38,015 --> 00:04:39,335
Marching nonstop has worn us out.

45
00:04:39,429 --> 00:04:41,240
Let's take a break here for now.

46
00:04:41,950 --> 00:04:43,152
Yes!

47
00:04:43,349 --> 00:04:46,000
(So, I still matter to you in your heart.)

48
00:04:48,669 --> 00:04:50,231
Until things are settled,

49
00:04:52,669 --> 00:04:54,752
your life matters more than anything.

50
00:05:12,430 --> 00:05:13,632
Censor Shen.

51
00:05:31,332 --> 00:05:32,534
Let's have a word.

52
00:05:41,875 --> 00:05:43,071
Now that things are this far,

53
00:05:43,252 --> 00:05:44,852
the three of us are already in the game.

54
00:05:45,229 --> 00:05:47,120
Rather than just watching you walk into danger,

55
00:05:47,821 --> 00:05:49,503
I'd rather play a risky move myself

56
00:05:49,636 --> 00:05:50,960
and go all in.

57
00:05:51,844 --> 00:05:53,764
You want to take on the Eastern Palace directly?

58
00:05:54,872 --> 00:05:56,100
The Crown Prince's confinement

59
00:05:56,206 --> 00:05:57,488
has shaken the emperor's trust.

60
00:05:57,990 --> 00:05:59,632
But to bring him down for good,

61
00:05:59,870 --> 00:06:01,586
we still need one final spark.

62
00:06:01,771 --> 00:06:03,254
Our trip to the Yellow River

63
00:06:03,669 --> 00:06:05,431
will add that spark.

64
00:06:09,971 --> 00:06:12,880
(Jingren County)

65
00:06:17,310 --> 00:06:18,719
I've angered His Majesty this time.

66
00:06:18,829 --> 00:06:20,437
It's actually a step back to move forward.

67
00:06:20,461 --> 00:06:21,981
I'm diving right into the tiger's den.

68
00:06:26,349 --> 00:06:27,991
While dealing with the flood,

69
00:06:28,229 --> 00:06:30,471
I'll start investigating the Crown Prince's cronies.

70
00:06:30,716 --> 00:06:33,478
I'll get proof of his embezzlement at the Yellow River.

71
00:06:43,477 --> 00:06:45,440
Is this the explanation you give me?

72
00:06:51,549 --> 00:06:53,040
You have to be careful.

73
00:06:53,207 --> 00:06:55,307
The Crown Prince forced Le Sheng into his territory

74
00:06:55,421 --> 00:06:57,062
because he wants Le Sheng's life.

75
00:07:03,862 --> 00:07:06,182
Don't worry. We'll be careful.

76
00:07:11,390 --> 00:07:13,547
Let the people and local officials see you

77
00:07:13,630 --> 00:07:14,706
and support you.

78
00:07:14,789 --> 00:07:17,746
This move will definitely catch His Majesty's eye

79
00:07:17,829 --> 00:07:19,107
and make the Crown Prince wary.

80
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:20,512
Thank you.

81
00:07:21,669 --> 00:07:22,871
Thank you.

82
00:07:25,022 --> 00:07:27,183
- Thank you, sir. - Thank you.

83
00:07:27,829 --> 00:07:29,031
Thank you.

84
00:07:32,667 --> 00:07:34,068
If the Crown Prince is panicking,

85
00:07:34,172 --> 00:07:36,000
we've achieved what we wanted.

86
00:07:36,549 --> 00:07:37,747
Please spare us.

87
00:07:37,870 --> 00:07:39,351
Let us go, please.

88
00:07:39,453 --> 00:07:41,775
Please spare us.

89
00:07:42,204 --> 00:07:43,687
Please spare us.

90
00:07:46,625 --> 00:07:49,262
(Ledger)

91
00:07:55,390 --> 00:07:56,787
When I get the evidence,

92
00:07:56,901 --> 00:07:58,422
I'll send word to you.

93
00:07:58,642 --> 00:08:00,173
Wait for us in the capital until we get back.

94
00:08:00,197 --> 00:08:02,120
- We'll face His Majesty together. - No.

95
00:08:02,388 --> 00:08:03,468
As soon as I hear from you,

96
00:08:03,538 --> 00:08:06,339
I'll head straight to the palace to accuse the Crown Prince of treason.

97
00:08:06,363 --> 00:08:08,988
Accusing him without proof is a death sentence.

98
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:11,645
The Crown Prince has to rebel for Father to strip him of his title.

99
00:08:11,669 --> 00:08:13,925
It's a risky move, but it kills two birds with one stone.

100
00:08:13,949 --> 00:08:15,461
First, it slows down the Crown Prince

101
00:08:15,542 --> 00:08:17,343
from going after you and Le Sheng at the Yellow River.

102
00:08:17,367 --> 00:08:19,499
Two, it deepens Father's suspicion.

103
00:08:19,611 --> 00:08:21,566
You can use this to get the Shence Camp's military token.

104
00:08:21,590 --> 00:08:24,245
- (The mission is done.) - While forcing the Crown Prince to rebel,

105
00:08:24,269 --> 00:08:26,032
it also secures the need to defend the king.

106
00:08:27,870 --> 00:08:30,792
(Next, it's my turn to step in.)

107
00:08:35,508 --> 00:08:36,744
You haven't slept in two days.

108
00:08:36,825 --> 00:08:37,982
Get some rest first.

109
00:08:38,063 --> 00:08:39,740
It's way too dangerous for Zhao Yang to enter the palace alone.

110
00:08:39,764 --> 00:08:41,840
We need to get the evidence to His Majesty fast.

111
00:09:41,552 --> 00:09:42,752
Attempting to murder a prince.

112
00:09:42,796 --> 00:09:45,640
Is the Cui family planning to get everyone in your clan killed?

113
00:09:47,989 --> 00:09:50,510
That only works if you make it back to the capital alive.

114
00:09:50,964 --> 00:09:52,080
Kill.

115
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:10,680
The evidence will be buried along with your dead bodies.

116
00:10:27,556 --> 00:10:28,758
Shen Xiao!

117
00:10:37,132 --> 00:10:39,604
From the moment you provoked Zhao Yang,

118
00:10:39,803 --> 00:10:41,320
you deserved to die.

119
00:10:47,365 --> 00:10:48,567
Shen Xiao!

120
00:10:57,956 --> 00:10:59,158
(Zhao Yang.)

121
00:10:59,300 --> 00:11:01,120
(You can only be mine.)

122
00:11:23,603 --> 00:11:26,467
(Chenji Hall)

123
00:11:28,470 --> 00:11:30,271
I, Li Shu, at the cost of my life,

124
00:11:30,792 --> 00:11:32,195
am accusing Crown Prince Li Chong

125
00:11:32,470 --> 00:11:33,871
of treason.

126
00:11:41,189 --> 00:11:42,432
Do you realize

127
00:11:43,230 --> 00:11:44,832
what you're saying?

128
00:11:51,175 --> 00:11:52,815
This is the evidence from three years ago

129
00:11:52,853 --> 00:11:54,815
of the impeachment of the Crown Prince

130
00:11:55,104 --> 00:11:56,613
regarding land seizure and grain hoarding

131
00:11:56,637 --> 00:11:58,757
by Registrar Shen Qing Zhi from the Bureau of Revenue

132
00:11:59,333 --> 00:12:01,169
under the pretext of building Qianfo Temple,

133
00:12:01,292 --> 00:12:03,172
The Crown Prince seized land and hoarded grain.

134
00:12:04,269 --> 00:12:06,326
He did it to secretly build up his own private army.

135
00:12:06,350 --> 00:12:07,952
Father, you'd see that right away.

136
00:12:21,350 --> 00:12:23,471
Evidence from three years ago,

137
00:12:24,230 --> 00:12:26,032
and now you're bringing it up

138
00:12:26,429 --> 00:12:28,280
to accuse the Crown Prince?

139
00:12:28,525 --> 00:12:29,727
That's not all.

140
00:12:30,662 --> 00:12:32,744
Shen Xiao and Le Sheng

141
00:12:33,036 --> 00:12:35,996
also found proof the Crown Prince was amassing troops at the Yellow River.

142
00:12:36,029 --> 00:12:37,271
To prevent any mishaps,

143
00:12:37,390 --> 00:12:38,832
I can't afford to wait any longer.

144
00:12:40,269 --> 00:12:41,631
Everything I'm doing

145
00:12:41,765 --> 00:12:43,646
is for your safety, Father.

146
00:12:45,741 --> 00:12:48,504
Father, I beg you to grant the Shence Camp command order.

147
00:12:48,973 --> 00:12:51,215
If the Crown Prince doesn't rebel within ten days,

148
00:12:51,822 --> 00:12:53,904
I will take my own life before the throne

149
00:12:54,069 --> 00:12:55,832
to atone for my reckless accusation.

150
00:13:07,390 --> 00:13:08,912
Zhao Yang.

151
00:13:10,830 --> 00:13:12,832
Are you going all out like this

152
00:13:13,870 --> 00:13:15,672
for my sake

153
00:13:16,750 --> 00:13:18,320
or is it because

154
00:13:19,036 --> 00:13:21,271
you'll force

155
00:13:22,159 --> 00:13:24,680
an old man

156
00:13:26,069 --> 00:13:28,832
like me to abdicate the throne

157
00:13:29,750 --> 00:13:31,560
once you get the command token?

158
00:13:47,988 --> 00:13:49,760
I, Yuan Shuo, bow before Your Majesty.

159
00:13:50,020 --> 00:13:52,548
From now on, the Shence Camp

160
00:13:52,789 --> 00:13:54,400
will secretly prepare the troops.

161
00:13:56,630 --> 00:13:58,680
Once my command token arrives,

162
00:13:59,470 --> 00:14:02,640
you may march straight into the Imperial City.

163
00:14:03,196 --> 00:14:04,719
I obey Your Majesty's order.

164
00:14:05,100 --> 00:14:06,422
Everyone in the Shence Camp

165
00:14:06,917 --> 00:14:08,119
is ready at all times.

166
00:14:21,269 --> 00:14:23,471
Draft another imperial decree.

167
00:14:24,685 --> 00:14:26,007
Starting today,

168
00:14:26,732 --> 00:14:28,054
order Zhao Yang

169
00:14:28,549 --> 00:14:30,349
to enter the palace and attend to my illness.

170
00:14:30,503 --> 00:14:32,760
Until I recover,

171
00:14:33,789 --> 00:14:35,880
no one is allowed to leave the palace

172
00:14:36,324 --> 00:14:37,887
without my special permission.

173
00:14:38,996 --> 00:14:40,160
Yes.

174
00:14:42,896 --> 00:14:44,828
Your Highness, it's terrible!

175
00:14:45,630 --> 00:14:47,351
A secret letter just arrived from the palace.

176
00:14:47,375 --> 00:14:48,988
His Majesty urgently summons...

177
00:14:49,069 --> 00:14:50,267
Bring it here.

178
00:14:50,348 --> 00:14:52,932
His Majesty urgently summons General Yuan Shuo of the Shence Camp

179
00:14:52,956 --> 00:14:55,676
and keeps Princess Zhao Yang to attend to his illness in the palace.

180
00:14:58,925 --> 00:15:00,544
(Suspicion is fire.)

181
00:15:01,292 --> 00:15:03,160
(Fear is the fuel.)

182
00:15:06,502 --> 00:15:08,765
Shen Xiao and Le Sheng are investigating me at the Yellow River,

183
00:15:08,789 --> 00:15:11,469
and Zhao Yang suddenly entered the palace to attend to the illness.

184
00:15:12,269 --> 00:15:14,440
Now, even the Shence Camp has been alerted.

185
00:15:15,630 --> 00:15:17,670
Father is about to move against the Eastern Palace.

186
00:15:18,533 --> 00:15:21,549
(Mobilizing troops and searching for evidence is all just a front.)

187
00:15:21,630 --> 00:15:23,787
(I want the Crown Prince to know)

188
00:15:23,895 --> 00:15:27,663
(that his biggest supporter now listens to me.)

189
00:15:27,798 --> 00:15:31,520
(I want him to know that he has nowhere left to retreat.)

190
00:15:33,069 --> 00:15:35,592
No. We can't wait any longer.

191
00:15:37,083 --> 00:15:38,085
Your Highness, calm down.

192
00:15:38,164 --> 00:15:40,684
Forcing the throne and killing the king is a path of no return.

193
00:15:40,839 --> 00:15:41,967
You.

194
00:15:42,069 --> 00:15:44,427
Get back to the Zheng family right away and notify Zheng Pu Yi.

195
00:15:44,451 --> 00:15:45,895
Have him contact all the noble families.

196
00:15:45,919 --> 00:15:47,384
Make sure my ascension goes smoothly.

197
00:15:47,408 --> 00:15:48,461
After it's done,

198
00:15:48,542 --> 00:15:51,263
I won't let down anyone who helped me ascend the throne.

199
00:15:52,189 --> 00:15:53,389
Notify Cui Jin Zhi right away.

200
00:15:53,430 --> 00:15:55,098
Prepare the troops immediately. Enter the capital.

201
00:15:55,122 --> 00:15:56,516
- Go! - Yes.

202
00:15:56,661 --> 00:15:58,960
No. Step back for now.

203
00:15:59,189 --> 00:16:00,559
Your Highness, you must not do this.

204
00:16:00,583 --> 00:16:02,165
Even if you succeed, you'll be cursed for eternity.

205
00:16:02,189 --> 00:16:05,029
The world will condemn you. The Zheng family would never agree to this.

206
00:16:05,126 --> 00:16:07,259
Besides, I think this might be a trap.

207
00:16:07,340 --> 00:16:09,734
Even if this is a trap, I will still become emperor.

208
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:11,169
Your Highness!

209
00:16:11,250 --> 00:16:12,877
If I die or get dethroned,

210
00:16:12,958 --> 00:16:16,874
what kind of fate will you, the Crown Princess, and your family face?

211
00:16:17,189 --> 00:16:19,589
I don't want Your Highness to walk down a path of no return.

212
00:16:20,072 --> 00:16:22,446
Besides, everything that's happened feels way too suspicious.

213
00:16:22,470 --> 00:16:23,872
It's like someone set this up on purpose

214
00:16:23,896 --> 00:16:25,045
to push Your Highness into making a move.

215
00:16:25,069 --> 00:16:26,672
Your Highness, think it over.

216
00:16:30,270 --> 00:16:33,032
Are you unwilling or just refusing?

217
00:16:33,285 --> 00:16:35,047
If you don't want

218
00:16:36,117 --> 00:16:38,079
this future position as the nation's mother,

219
00:16:39,125 --> 00:16:40,527
someone else will take your place.

220
00:16:42,839 --> 00:16:45,399
Move! Crown Prince is just confined to his quarters.

221
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:47,140
He's still the master of the Eastern Palace.

222
00:16:47,164 --> 00:16:48,366
Move!

223
00:16:49,484 --> 00:16:50,720
All of you, move!

224
00:16:54,701 --> 00:16:55,903
Crown Prince.

225
00:16:56,333 --> 00:16:57,535
Crown Prince.

226
00:16:57,949 --> 00:16:59,845
Father let Zhao Yang enter the palace to attend to his illness.

227
00:16:59,869 --> 00:17:02,540
I wanted to visit the palace, but I was stopped outside the hall.

228
00:17:02,637 --> 00:17:04,239
What's going on?

229
00:17:07,875 --> 00:17:09,837
Father really trusts her.

230
00:17:10,893 --> 00:17:12,295
He doesn't trust me anymore.

231
00:17:12,588 --> 00:17:13,999
What's wrong?

232
00:17:14,229 --> 00:17:15,630
What did she do?

233
00:17:19,764 --> 00:17:21,440
Do you think she's just like you,

234
00:17:22,140 --> 00:17:24,840
a useless person who only knows how to enjoy life?

235
00:17:31,214 --> 00:17:32,800
Crown Prince,

236
00:17:33,813 --> 00:17:37,214
I suddenly feel a bit unwell.

237
00:17:37,701 --> 00:17:39,123
I'm heading back first.

238
00:17:39,204 --> 00:17:40,406
An Le.

239
00:17:48,070 --> 00:17:49,472
Crown Prince.

240
00:17:49,669 --> 00:17:52,032
Why are you looking at me like this?

241
00:17:58,350 --> 00:17:59,552
An Le,

242
00:17:59,742 --> 00:18:01,419
when Zhao Yang gains power,

243
00:18:01,526 --> 00:18:03,367
that's when you and I will meet our end.

244
00:18:04,485 --> 00:18:06,608
So, we absolutely can't

245
00:18:07,116 --> 00:18:09,439
let her and Le Sheng win.

246
00:18:10,678 --> 00:18:11,880
Understand?

247
00:18:14,356 --> 00:18:15,406
No.

248
00:18:15,509 --> 00:18:16,792
I don't understand.

249
00:18:17,677 --> 00:18:19,398
If the Eastern Palace falls,

250
00:18:20,117 --> 00:18:22,198
what kind of fate will you face?

251
00:18:23,260 --> 00:18:25,063
At such a critical moment,

252
00:18:25,597 --> 00:18:27,519
are you really going to run away?

253
00:18:32,189 --> 00:18:34,842
But I don't know how to do anything.

254
00:18:36,085 --> 00:18:37,287
An Le,

255
00:18:37,668 --> 00:18:39,029
you can do it.

256
00:18:39,453 --> 00:18:40,655
You will.

257
00:18:41,053 --> 00:18:44,080
You're a hundred and a thousand times better than Zhao Yang.

258
00:18:45,870 --> 00:18:47,552
You are

259
00:18:47,870 --> 00:18:49,272
the smartest

260
00:18:49,429 --> 00:18:52,552
and Father's most beloved eldest princess of Ye.

261
00:19:08,181 --> 00:19:09,383
Your Highness.​

262
00:19:19,618 --> 00:19:20,820
Jian Xin.

263
00:19:21,250 --> 00:19:22,732
Tell Sister

264
00:19:23,310 --> 00:19:24,792
that Shen Xiao is...

265
00:19:25,749 --> 00:19:27,066
Your Highness,

266
00:19:27,149 --> 00:19:29,792
His Majesty requests you to attend to his illness in the palace.

267
00:19:39,149 --> 00:19:40,871
(When Zhao Yang gains power, )

268
00:19:40,989 --> 00:19:42,832
(that's when you and I will meet our end.)

269
00:19:42,949 --> 00:19:44,151
So,

270
00:19:45,070 --> 00:19:47,072
we absolutely can't let her

271
00:19:47,550 --> 00:19:48,832
and Le Sheng win.

272
00:19:50,189 --> 00:19:51,391
Understand?

273
00:20:12,676 --> 00:20:13,833
Father!

274
00:20:13,923 --> 00:20:14,984
Father!

275
00:20:15,065 --> 00:20:17,963
I heard Father is unwell, so I came to attend to you.

276
00:20:18,059 --> 00:20:19,136
Let me in!

277
00:20:19,217 --> 00:20:20,949
By His Majesty's order, except for Princess Zhao Yang,

278
00:20:20,973 --> 00:20:22,066
no one else may visit.

279
00:20:22,235 --> 00:20:24,104
How dare you block me?

280
00:20:24,220 --> 00:20:25,960
Father!

281
00:20:28,143 --> 00:20:29,419
Who do you think you are?

282
00:20:29,500 --> 00:20:30,742
How dare you block me?

283
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:40,469
Zhao Yang, don't get cocky.

284
00:20:40,550 --> 00:20:42,470
Don't think just because you attended to Father,

285
00:20:42,532 --> 00:20:44,494
he'll think highly of you.

286
00:20:45,524 --> 00:20:47,800
Since you know His Majesty is unwell,

287
00:20:48,022 --> 00:20:49,704
how dare you make a scene here?

288
00:20:50,197 --> 00:20:52,346
- Throw her out. - Yes.

289
00:20:52,764 --> 00:20:53,966
You dare?

290
00:20:55,820 --> 00:20:57,590
You still have the nerve to block me?

291
00:20:57,671 --> 00:20:58,972
Let me tell you.

292
00:20:59,186 --> 00:21:02,160
That Shen Xiao of yours is already dead.

293
00:21:05,550 --> 00:21:06,752
What did you say?

294
00:21:09,870 --> 00:21:11,191
I said

295
00:21:12,590 --> 00:21:15,431
Shen Xiao is dead.

296
00:21:20,870 --> 00:21:22,871
You'll be joining him soon.

297
00:21:27,350 --> 00:21:28,871
Vile woman!

298
00:21:30,149 --> 00:21:32,431
- You dare hit me? - Don't move.

299
00:21:37,909 --> 00:21:41,440
Your Highness, you must not act out inside the palace.

300
00:21:41,804 --> 00:21:42,899
By order of the Crown Prince,

301
00:21:42,923 --> 00:21:44,758
the guards in the Imperial City are led by the Ministry of War

302
00:21:44,782 --> 00:21:46,146
to protect His Majesty's safety.

303
00:21:46,283 --> 00:21:48,963
Princess An Le will attend to His Majesty's illness starting today.

304
00:21:50,270 --> 00:21:51,832
His Majesty is still ill.

305
00:21:52,189 --> 00:21:54,391
Go inside quickly and attend to His Majesty.

306
00:22:05,670 --> 00:22:07,186
Cui Jin Zhi, what are you doing?

307
00:22:07,316 --> 00:22:08,919
Take Princess Zhao Yang away.

308
00:22:09,270 --> 00:22:10,467
Treat her well.

309
00:22:10,589 --> 00:22:11,791
Yes.

310
00:22:24,261 --> 00:22:27,063
Father, please don't blame me.

311
00:22:27,917 --> 00:22:29,879
You listened to Zhao Yang's slander

312
00:22:31,669 --> 00:22:33,549
and even confined Crown Prince in his quarters.

313
00:22:40,909 --> 00:22:42,365
Even when you're seriously ill,

314
00:22:42,446 --> 00:22:44,128
you chose her to attend to you.
